0:{"buildId":"PJ101VrCeOrIiWypc671Y","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"min-h-screen bg-bg pt-24","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Fix Agency Handoff Debt to Stop Landing Page Conversion Leaks\",\"description\":\"You hired an agency, got a great landing page, then handed it to a developer. Here are 7 ways it quietly stopped working - and how to find them.\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/#founder\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-07-25\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-07-25\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/#organization\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/learning-centre/agency-handoff-debt\"},\"image\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/opengraph-image\"}"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-14","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/learning-centre","className":"text-sm font-semibold text-accent hover:text-fg transition-colors","children":"← Learning Centre"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8 md:p-10","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-block rounded-full bg-accent/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent","children":"Landing Page Leaks"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-3xl font-bold leading-tight text-fg md:text-4xl","children":"Fix Agency Handoff Debt to Stop Landing Page Conversion Leaks"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-5 text-lg text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":"The agency delivered. You reviewed it, approved it, and it was converting. Then you handed it to a developer for \"a few minor tweaks\" - and three months later you're wondering why traffic went up but leads went down. This is agency handoff debt: the compounding damage that accumulates when a page moves from the people who optimised it to the people who maintain it. It isn't malice. It isn't even carelessness. It's the seven specific changes that almost always happen, each individually defensible, together devastating."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/audit?utm_source=learning-centre-agency-handoff-debt&utm_medium=hero-cta","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-bg transition-opacity hover:opacity-85","children":"Get your free audit →"}],["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/repair-sprint","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded border border-border px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:border-fg-muted hover:text-fg","children":"Explore $97 Repair Sprint"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-fg","children":"1. The Meta Description That Got \"Cleaned Up\""}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Agency copywriters write meta descriptions at 155–160 characters because that's the search-result cutoff. They test the phrasing, include a verb, and front-load the value prop. When a developer consolidates the head section or migrates to a new CMS, the description often gets shortened - either truncated manually or dropped to a generic fallback. Google rewrites your snippet, click-through rate drops 10–20%, and nothing in your analytics dashboard tells you why."}],"$L3"]}],"$L4","$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc"]}]]}],null,"$Ld"]}],"isPartial":"$@e","staleTime":"$f","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L10","isPartial":"$@11","staleTime":"$f","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L12","isPartial":"$@13","staleTime":"$f","varyParams":"$14"},{"rsc":"$L15","isPartial":"$@16","staleTime":"$f","varyParams":null}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@17","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@18"}
